---
title: "MemLite add() — LLM extraction (required) + deterministic reconcile"
---
flowchart TD
    A["m.add(text, …)<br/>user_id · memory_type"] --> B["_to_texts()<br/>str | messages → list[str]"]
    B --> NO[/"no LLM configured?"/]
    NO -->|yes| ER(["ValueError — LLM required for extraction"])

    B -->|"LLM configured (the only path)"| P["LLM extraction pass<br/>discrete durable facts<br/>(retractions bypass extraction —<br/>DELETE intent preserved)"]
    P --> F["embed_many(facts)<br/>one batched API call"]
    F --> G["semantic_search top-5 in scope<br/>vec0 · distance_metric=cosine<br/>(was silent L2 — fixed)"]
    G --> H{"_decide()<br/>pure fn · unit tests"}

    %% ---- _decide outcomes ----
    H -->|"retraction intent + cos ≥ 0.82"| DEL["DELETE<br/>&quot;forget / no longer&quot; regex<br/>+ &quot;don't forget&quot; negation guard<br/>(0.82: destructive bar)"]
    H -->|"cos ≥ 0.65 AND shared content-bigram<br/>OR cos ≥ 0.90 duplicate guard"| UPD["UPDATE — same claim, new value<br/>attribute key phrase survives<br/>(&quot;favorite color&quot;) · same id kept"]
    H -->|"else"| ADD(["ADD — conservative default<br/>wrong ADD = duplicate ·<br/>wrong UPDATE/DELETE = data loss"])

    %% ---- store ----
    DEL --> S["one SQLite transaction<br/>memories + vec0 + FTS5 + history<br/>(BEGIN IMMEDIATE → COMMIT, single fsync)"]
    UPD --> S
    ADD --> S
